  "ingredients": [
    "1 9-inch pie crust",
    "5 large Granny Smith apples - peeled, cored and sliced",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pXyjmK_egrdTFPPS6DGqt9LFElc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-01-70485fe980ef46e09f8b8ff17cc54390.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange pastry in the bottom of a 9-inch pie pan. Place apples in crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IwNdRIZ9Oqgik9uVUasXaS6nMRk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-02-4442fe89ca5d4ad387989bbc9d19d432.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1/2 cup sugar, 2 tablespoons flour, and cinnamon together in a bowl; pour over apples in crust. Sprinkle lemon juice on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r4LXWWUozSTT73DDoqCvdhyeYMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-03-6542611279b340ba9c918cf241f38fae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crumble topping: Place 1/2 cup sugar and 1/2 cup flour in a bowl. Cut in cold butter with 2 knives or pastry blender until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs; sprinkle crumble mixture evenly over apples.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hFNFoHk9F8cNN-Cfng5dt9Fm3O8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-04-d48631ef613e479d92efacf33a473907.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take two 15-inch pieces of parchment paper and enclose pie; fold edges up 3 times. Place on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-HslJ4za4kxA5LfR27UsT7Cg1yw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-05-48bd2659f5b44f11a43b17f0e124e878.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, without opening the parchment, for 1 hour. Remove from oven, split parchment open, and cool pie on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xnvcpf7EbnXEknc6pScIyOC8hZY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12191-dutch-apple-pie-VAT-step-06-7f81e52a451142bcb803a87904cdd45f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12191/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm, or at room temperature.",
